    "chunk_text": "\u00f0e mere to Bilsetnetun, & to Wodnesfeld & erest of Hindebroce in \u00f0eo dic bitwonem Onlang \u00f0a dic forte cume \u00f0er, \u00f0eo dic went estward, & of \u00f0am dice for\u00fe on \u00f0one \u00f0orne \u00f0ar \u00fea \u00f0reo & of \u00f0am \u00f0ore in \u00feone lece mere, & of \u00fea mere on \u00feone ford \u00feer beorgi\u00fees sanes strete li\u00fe ofer, & of \u00fea & nor\u00feward ford efter dic \u00feet on piates \u00feorn, and of \u00fee \u00feorne efter \u00feere dic on Penwie \u00feer & for\u00fe onlang penwies in Byribroc & of \u00fea broce \u00feat on \u00feone Ealrescagen, & efter Ealrescagan on \u00feat & of \u00fea stane on \u00fea suinsete, & of \u00feare suinsete onlang strete hat on \u00feara dic, onlang dic \u00feet on & efter sic on \u00feone broc in Beadgi\u00feeburne, & of \u00fea burne into landebroce onlang \u00fees broces on This beo\u00fe \u00fea land ymere betuone Kinpaldestune & Eatuue. Erest of \u00fea broce on \u00fean heafdan on \u00feone dic, onlang dices in \u00feono\u00feorne broce, \u00e6fter \u00fean broce into Onlang dic into Sealtmere, \u00feer ofer \u00feone mere on \u00fea dic, efter \u00feere dic wi\u00fe easten ryecroft on \u00feone fule This is \u00feo ymere into Hage\u00feorndune. Erest of Searesbrocesforde on Holeweie, & of \u00fean weie on \u00feat longa strete, & of \u00feare strete on \u00feone Anlang Heies on \u00fereo ymere, & of \u00fereo ymere on E\u00feelwier heie on \u00feone feld on \u00feone Ihau, & \u00feanen on Onlang sledes op on ea & \u00feat eastward on \u00feat o\u00feer sled, efter \u00fe",
